      "title": "Keep the Chain Consistent",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "When one sentence uses several generic references, keep the chain easy to follow. Mixing "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "man",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "en",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ", and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "du",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " without a reason can make the sentence sound uneven."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hvis man leser nøye, finner man ofte feilen selv."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "If one reads carefully, one often finds the mistake oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hvis en får tydelige frister, blir det lettere å planlegge tiden sin."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "If one gets clear deadlines, it becomes easier to plan one's time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Når du jobber hjemmefra, mister du lett skillet mellom jobb og fritid."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "When you work from home, you can easily lose the boundary between work and free time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "tip",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "A quick editing test: if the sentence needs an object or possessive, "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "man",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " cannot do the whole job. Switch to "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "en",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " or "
                },
                {
                  "kind": "foreign_term",
                  "value": "ens",
                  "lang": "no"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": " where the grammar requires it."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
